{
 "duration": 54.831,
 "frames": 1645,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Why do we wrap things in bubble wrap?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.113
  },
  {
   "text": "Because it failed...",
   "start": 2.594,
   "end": 3.538
  },
  {
   "text": "twice.",
   "start": 3.985,
   "end": 4.627
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen fifty-seven,",
   "start": 5.245,
   "end": 6.552
  },
  {
   "text": "two engineers in New Jersey,",
   "start": 6.754,
   "end": 8.254
  },
  {
   "text": "Alfred Fielding and Marc Chavannes,",
   "start": 8.478,
   "end": 11.801
  },
  {
   "text": "had a wild idea: wallpaper you could touch.",
   "start": 12.334,
   "end": 13.971
  },
  {
   "text": "They sealed two sheets of plastic together,",
   "start": 14.518,
   "end": 17.0
  },
  {
   "text": "trapping rows of tiny air bubbles.",
   "start": 17.0,
   "end": 19.032
  },
  {
   "text": "Bumpy,",
   "start": 19.473,
   "end": 20.128
  },
  {
   "text": "shiny,",
   "start": 20.128,
   "end": 20.782
  },
  {
   "text": "futuristic.",
   "start": 21.038,
   "end": 21.972
  },
  {
   "text": "And nobody wanted it on their walls.",
   "start": 22.437,
   "end": 24.767
  },
  {
   "text": "So they tried again.",
   "start": 25.217,
   "end": 26.457
  },
  {
   "text": "Greenhouse insulation!",
   "start": 26.901,
   "end": 28.218
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep the plants warm with bubbles.",
   "start": 28.5,
   "end": 30.376
  },
  {
   "text": "That flopped too.",
   "start": 30.843,
   "end": 31.91
  },
  {
   "text": "But then,",
   "start": 32.479,
   "end": 33.013
  },
  {
   "text": "IBM had a problem.",
   "start": 33.254,
   "end": 34.641
  },
  {
   "text": "It was shipping its brand-new computer,",
   "start": 35.053,
   "end": 36.982
  },
  {
   "text": "and it needed something soft enough to keep it from breaking.",
   "start": 37.169,
   "end": 39.893
  },
  {
   "text": "Those failed bubbles were perfect.",
   "start": 40.348,
   "end": 42.466
  },
  {
   "text": "Today,",
   "start": 43.011,
   "end": 43.451
  },
  {
   "text": "bubble wrap protects almost everything we ship.",
   "start": 43.655,
   "end": 46.1
  },
  {
   "text": "And it gave the whole world a new hobby:",
   "start": 46.527,
   "end": 48.66
  },
  {
   "text": "pop,",
   "start": 49.07,
   "end": 49.21
  },
  {
   "text": "pop,",
   "start": 49.46,
   "end": 49.6
  },
  {
   "text": "pop.",
   "start": 49.83,
   "end": 50.12
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we wrap things in bubble wrap.",
   "start": 50.603,
   "end": 52.483
  },
  {
   "text": "It was supposed to hang on your walls.",
   "start": 52.831,
   "end": 54.615
  }
 ]
}